  "Generate it on a computer signed in to Claude Code with {command}. Screenshots never pass through Vercel.": ["Genéralo en un ordenador con sesión en Claude Code usando {command}. Las capturas nunca pasan por Vercel.", "Générez-le sur un ordinateur connecté à Claude Code avec {command}. Les captures ne transitent jamais par Vercel.", "Erzeuge sie auf einem Rechner mit Claude-Code-Anmeldung per {command}. Screenshots laufen nie über Vercel.", "Generalo su un computer collegato a Claude Code con {command}. Gli screenshot non passano mai da Vercel.", "أنشئه على جهاز مسجّل الدخول إلى Claude Code باستخدام {command}. لا تمرّ لقطات الشاشة عبر Vercel أبدًا.", "สร้างไฟล์บนคอมพิวเตอร์ที่ลงชื่อเข้าใช้ Claude Code ด้วย {command} ภาพหน้าจอจะไม่ผ่าน Vercel", "在已登录 Claude Code 的电脑上使用 {command} 生成。截图不会经过 Vercel。", "Claude Code에 로그인한 컴퓨터에서 {command} 명령으로 생성하세요. 스크린샷은 Vercel을 거치지 않습니다.", "Claude Code'a giriş yapılmış bir bilgisayarda {command} ile oluşturun. Ekran görüntüleri asla Vercel üzerinden geçmez."],
